  "instructions": [
    "Rinse the rice thoroughly and cook according to package instructions.",
    "Prepare the nuka-pickle by slicing it into thin strips.",
    "In a small saucepan, heat the soy sauce and sesame oil over low heat.",
    "Add the toasted sesame seeds to the saucepan and stir to combine.",
    "To assemble the dish, place a scoop of cooked rice onto a banana leaf.",
    "Top the rice with a spoonful of nuka-pickle and a drizzle of yuja jam.",
    "Drizzle the soy sauce and sesame oil mixture over the top.",
    "Serve immediately and enjoy.",
    "Garnish with additional toasted sesame seeds if desired."
